Package: xinbot-box-manager
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: newPlayerAL <200553324+newPlayerAL@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: adduser, libc6, libgcc-s1
Recommends: openjdk-21-jre-headless | java21-runtime-headless
Homepage: https://github.com/newPlayerAL/xinbot-box-manager
Description: lightweight web manager for XinBot instances
 XinBot Box Manager provides a browser-based interface for configuring and
 running a small number of isolated XinBot instances on a headless Linux host.
